    "show_share": true,
    "description": "The Aga Khan University Graduate School of Media and Communications is set to host a pioneering suite of courses designed to transform leadership in Africa. Launching in November 2017, Transforming Leadership for 21st Century Africa brings together two world class courses designed to equip executives with the skills, mindset and communication expertise to better lead their organization - and Africa itself - in our increasingly complex and rapidly changing world.",
